  faqs={[
    { q: 'How do I catch up when I am really far behind?', a: 'List everything outstanding, rank it by deadline and importance, and cut or defer the low-value items on purpose. Then pick one task to finish today. Catching up is a series of small wins, not one giant push.' },
    { q: 'Should I tell my teacher I am behind?', a: 'Yes, and sooner rather than later. Teachers can offer extensions, point you to what matters most, or adjust expectations, but almost always only before the deadline, not after you have missed it silently.' },
